WEBVTT

01:30.160 --> 01:34.850
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.220 --> 01:37.830
[Episode 5]

01:40.150 --> 01:41.550
And what are you here for?

01:41.640 --> 01:42.700
To present a blade.

01:43.910 --> 01:46.250
Sister, look. He looks like...

01:48.680 --> 01:49.680
Be careful, miss.

01:50.120 --> 01:51.520
This blade drinks blood.

01:54.350 --> 01:56.039
He made it sound quite mysterious.

01:56.039 --> 01:56.900
Hey, young man.

01:57.120 --> 01:59.560
The precious blade the patron wants
is here.

01:59.560 --> 02:01.810
If you know what's good for you, get lost!

02:01.810 --> 02:04.140
Miss, please take me to present the blade.

02:07.740 --> 02:08.500
Stop.

02:22.500 --> 02:23.680
This guy knows demonic arts!

02:23.680 --> 02:25.010
Get that blade from him!

02:32.800 --> 02:34.470
Can I present my blade now?

02:34.960 --> 02:36.060
Hero,

02:36.910 --> 02:39.240
the patron is waiting in the main chamber.

02:42.079 --> 02:42.910
Hero,

02:43.880 --> 02:45.880
you don't look like an ordinary man.

02:46.190 --> 02:48.680
If this truly is a demon-slaying blade,

02:49.280 --> 02:50.590
after you get your reward,

02:50.590 --> 02:52.190
don't forget to let us

02:52.360 --> 02:54.160
share a bit of your good fortune.

03:10.360 --> 03:13.800
I heard you are offering a hefty sum
to acquire a demon-slaying blade.

03:13.800 --> 03:15.330
I have come to present mine.

03:34.590 --> 03:35.360
Inspect it.

03:51.390 --> 03:52.150
It's you?

03:56.670 --> 03:57.940
Was it Hong Ye

03:58.430 --> 04:00.560
who sent you to take my blade?

04:02.470 --> 04:03.560
What did Hong Ye

04:03.560 --> 04:05.080
do to you

04:06.070 --> 04:07.900
to make you obey his every word

04:08.750 --> 04:11.240
and even forget that you were once human?

04:16.829 --> 04:17.760
Master Bingzhu,

04:18.070 --> 04:19.470
let me be honest with you.

04:19.750 --> 04:21.430
During my time in the Demons' Valley,

04:21.430 --> 04:23.190
it was the demons who fed me, clothed me,

04:23.190 --> 04:24.970
and gave me shelter.

04:25.270 --> 04:27.950
Anyone with eyes, a heart,
and a brain knows that

04:27.950 --> 04:29.600
those minor demons
who have just taken human form

04:29.600 --> 04:31.040
and are newly sentient

04:31.040 --> 04:33.170
are no different from human children.

04:33.920 --> 04:35.750
They never leave the Demons' Valley,

04:35.750 --> 04:37.390
cultivating and playing there.

04:37.390 --> 04:38.860
Their nature is kind.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.590
Not only have they never hurt me,

04:40.590 --> 04:42.450
but they have also brought me joy.

04:43.070 --> 04:44.260
Yet some people

04:44.360 --> 04:46.120
judge all demons as guilty
and deserving of death

04:46.120 --> 04:48.240
because of the evil deeds of a few.

04:48.830 --> 04:50.260
How is that fair?

04:50.360 --> 04:53.159
It seems those demons
have truly brainwashed you.

04:55.000 --> 04:56.640
Fine, let me ask you.

04:56.870 --> 05:00.130
Have you ever seen a demon
devour a human with your own eyes?

05:13.860 --> 05:15.980
I have seen such bloody scenes

05:17.560 --> 05:18.480
many times.

05:24.390 --> 05:25.080
Anyway,

05:25.560 --> 05:26.960
if it weren't for that day

05:27.270 --> 05:28.720
when you sent me to Qingyuan Mountain,

05:28.720 --> 05:30.270
none of what followed would have happened.

05:30.270 --> 05:30.920
Xiao Yao.

05:32.420 --> 05:34.080
I know you're sharp-tongued.

05:35.070 --> 05:37.070
But I also know you have a pure heart.

05:38.800 --> 05:41.120
What exactly happened
after you fell off the cliff

05:41.120 --> 05:42.380
at Qingyuan Mountain?

05:42.990 --> 05:45.610
I want you to tell me everything
in detail,

05:46.070 --> 05:47.630
without a single lie.

05:50.830 --> 05:52.480
That day when I fell off the cliff,

05:52.480 --> 05:54.040
I thought I was done for.

05:54.060 --> 05:54.900
But suddenly,

05:55.270 --> 05:57.000
a person appeared from the sky.

05:59.750 --> 06:00.410
That's all?

06:00.920 --> 06:01.630
Yes.

06:02.240 --> 06:04.760
I have told you everything that happened

06:04.780 --> 06:06.710
before you stepped into this room.

06:08.480 --> 06:10.340
Just now while you were speaking,

06:10.630 --> 06:12.160
my sword didn't move at all.

06:12.720 --> 06:13.980
It shows it trusts you.

06:15.170 --> 06:16.200
So I trust you too.

06:20.510 --> 06:24.040
Why does this blade seem alive?

06:24.310 --> 06:26.560
Did you cast a spell on it,

06:26.560 --> 06:28.750
or was something added

06:28.750 --> 06:30.120
when it was forged?

06:33.830 --> 06:34.830
It's not a blade.

06:36.720 --> 06:37.560
It's a person.

06:38.480 --> 06:40.340
A person who was killed
by a demon.

06:41.310 --> 06:43.180
Her soul was bound to this blade.

06:43.790 --> 06:46.920
She wants me to slay
all evil demons in the world with her.

06:50.520 --> 06:51.390
Tell me more.

06:54.270 --> 06:55.830
Our family served in the military

06:55.830 --> 06:57.120
for generations.

06:57.950 --> 06:59.560
But my father was framed by villains,

06:59.560 --> 07:00.820
reduced to a commoner,

07:01.070 --> 07:02.670
and soon died of depression.

07:03.390 --> 07:05.270
His greatest wish was for me

07:05.270 --> 07:07.470
to return to the army,

07:07.560 --> 07:09.190
clear our family's name,

07:09.220 --> 07:10.600
and serve the court.

07:11.040 --> 07:13.390
Since then,
my sister and I have relied on each other.

07:13.390 --> 07:13.800
Bingzhu.

07:13.800 --> 07:16.040
I practiced our family's blade techniques
every day,

07:16.040 --> 07:18.570
hoping to fulfill
my father's last wish soon.

07:22.510 --> 07:24.680
Didn't you promise me
you wouldn't go again?

07:24.680 --> 07:25.210
Let's go.

07:26.830 --> 07:29.210
But Bingzhu,
there are so many taxes these days.

07:29.210 --> 07:30.870
If I don't help you earn money,

07:31.000 --> 07:33.330
when will you save enough
to buy the blade?

07:33.510 --> 07:34.909
Martial skills don't depend on the weapon.

07:34.909 --> 07:35.680
Wait for me here.

07:35.680 --> 07:36.040
Okay.

07:39.430 --> 07:40.430
Give me your hand.

07:44.630 --> 07:45.430
But Bingzhu,

07:46.560 --> 07:48.820
every time you pass the blacksmith shop,

07:49.070 --> 07:51.040
your eyes lock onto that...

07:51.920 --> 07:52.980
that blade inside.

07:54.080 --> 07:55.610
I've noticed it every time.

07:55.630 --> 07:56.290
No, I don't.

07:58.310 --> 07:59.370
The court requires

07:59.600 --> 08:00.950
that you bring your own weapon

08:00.950 --> 08:02.680
to be eligible to join the army.

08:03.160 --> 08:03.720
Bingzhu,

08:04.240 --> 08:05.630
with your martial skills,

08:05.630 --> 08:08.190
you'll surely become a general
if you join the army.

08:08.190 --> 08:09.320
Consider this money

08:09.480 --> 08:10.750
a loan from me.

08:11.190 --> 08:13.790
Just pay me back double in the future,
General.

08:18.360 --> 08:19.920
When I become a general,

08:20.950 --> 08:23.040
I'll buy you the finest clothes.

08:23.190 --> 08:24.920
We'll live in the finest house.

08:25.090 --> 08:25.680
Mm-hmm.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.440
And by then,

08:29.270 --> 08:30.800
I should also find you

08:30.800 --> 08:32.330
the most virtuous husband.

08:32.909 --> 08:33.750
Bingzhu!

08:35.480 --> 08:36.240
You're home?

08:37.390 --> 08:38.320
That's perfect.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.360
Mr. Song?

08:39.600 --> 08:41.510
We've already paid the rent
and contributions.

08:41.510 --> 08:41.960
Yes,

08:42.120 --> 08:43.549
you paid the previous ones,

08:43.549 --> 08:45.360
but new contributions have been assigned.

08:45.360 --> 08:46.800
Spring plowing is coming,

08:46.800 --> 08:49.120
but Heaven
hasn't given a single drop of rain.

08:49.120 --> 08:51.270
Our neighbors around the nearby villages

08:51.270 --> 08:53.510
want to pitch in to find a bride
for Lord Locust Tree

08:53.510 --> 08:54.440
to pray for rain.

08:56.510 --> 08:57.440
We have no money.

08:59.030 --> 09:00.080
It's a mandatory contribution.

09:00.080 --> 09:01.480
There's nothing I can do.

09:01.960 --> 09:02.510
Come on.

09:04.270 --> 09:05.720
Bingzhu! Bingzhu!

09:05.840 --> 09:06.320
What are you doing?

09:06.320 --> 09:06.850
Bingzhu!

09:07.030 --> 09:07.690
Don't move.

09:08.270 --> 09:09.840
Don't do anything.

09:09.840 --> 09:10.600
-You'll make trouble if you do anything.
-Bingzhu.

09:10.600 --> 09:11.750
Let Tan'er go!

09:13.240 --> 09:14.500
Just a routine search.

09:14.600 --> 09:16.120
Every household says they have no money.

09:16.120 --> 09:18.450
How am I supposed to report
to my superior?

09:18.950 --> 09:19.410
Search.

09:19.480 --> 09:20.000
Okay!

09:21.360 --> 09:22.760
Tan'er, don't be afraid.

09:23.840 --> 09:25.240
Yes, search that chicken coop.

09:25.240 --> 09:25.750
Okay.

09:29.150 --> 09:30.320
Bingzhu! Bingzhu!

09:31.600 --> 09:33.080
Bingzhu! Bingzhu!

09:35.080 --> 09:36.000
That's enough.

09:37.550 --> 09:38.360
Alright, alright.

09:38.360 --> 09:39.820
There's still some money?

09:41.510 --> 09:43.240
Well, why bother?

09:43.240 --> 09:44.390
Bingzhu! Bingzhu!

09:44.720 --> 09:45.250
Bingzhu!

09:45.480 --> 09:46.940
Bingzhu, are you alright?

09:49.150 --> 09:49.960
Keep it for firewood.

09:49.960 --> 09:51.220
So it won't go to waste.

09:51.840 --> 09:52.370
Let's go.

09:53.310 --> 09:54.080
Does it hurt?

09:54.080 --> 09:55.360
Did they hurt you?

10:01.360 --> 10:02.600
Song!

10:03.550 --> 10:04.200
Bingzhu!

10:04.390 --> 10:06.240
Don't go!

10:06.240 --> 10:07.030
Don't go!

10:08.200 --> 10:09.000
Don't go!

10:09.870 --> 10:11.200
I'm fine. I'm fine.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.100
I'm fine.

10:13.270 --> 10:14.320
Don't go.

10:18.150 --> 10:19.910
Really, I'm fine.

10:20.030 --> 10:20.840
It's me...

10:21.390 --> 10:22.240
I'm the one

10:24.380 --> 10:25.940
who put you through this.

10:27.290 --> 10:29.170
No, no.

10:54.390 --> 10:55.000
Bingzhu.

10:57.150 --> 10:57.840
It's late.

10:57.840 --> 10:58.840
Go get some sleep.

11:00.960 --> 11:02.720
I need to prepare a few more goods

11:02.720 --> 11:05.120
to deliver to Mr. Li's residence tomorrow.

11:06.440 --> 11:07.500
You go to bed first.

11:18.070 --> 11:19.860
We can always earn more money.

11:22.510 --> 11:24.370
But if you hurt someone in a fight,

11:26.030 --> 11:28.360
you'll never be eligible to join the army.

11:39.860 --> 11:41.190
I won't get into a fight.

11:41.550 --> 11:42.080
Get up.

11:46.270 --> 11:48.510
Go to bed. Did you hear me?

11:49.450 --> 11:49.960
Bingzhu.

11:49.960 --> 11:50.630
Sleep well.

11:51.910 --> 11:52.710
Be a good girl.

11:53.440 --> 11:54.360
I'll finish those things

11:54.360 --> 11:55.490
and then go to sleep.

12:19.270 --> 12:19.930
Bingzhu...

12:37.320 --> 12:37.870
Tan'er?

12:40.870 --> 12:41.390
Tan'er?

13:20.320 --> 13:21.000
Tan'er!

13:22.030 --> 13:23.080
Your sister

13:23.150 --> 13:24.330
came early this morning.

13:24.330 --> 13:25.680
She paid 20 taels of silver

13:25.680 --> 13:26.930
to buy this blade

13:27.320 --> 13:28.580
and asked me to tell you

13:28.720 --> 13:30.450
that she only signed a contract

13:30.550 --> 13:32.080
to sell herself as a servant
to the landlord

13:32.080 --> 13:33.680
in East Village for 10 years,

13:33.740 --> 13:35.180
with food and lodging provided.

13:35.180 --> 13:35.980
And she said

13:36.130 --> 13:37.910
you should take the blade
and join the army,

13:37.910 --> 13:39.170
achieve great things,

13:39.180 --> 13:40.510
and not worry about her.

13:41.390 --> 13:42.750
May I see the silver Tan'er used

13:42.750 --> 13:43.960
to buy the blade?

13:49.630 --> 13:50.390
Song!

13:51.700 --> 13:52.760
Where is my sister?

13:53.310 --> 13:54.780
Tan'er is a good girl.

13:55.250 --> 13:56.510
She came to me this morning

13:56.510 --> 13:58.930
and said she was willing to marry
Lord Locust Tree voluntarily.

13:58.930 --> 14:01.440
She took the betrothal money
and has already been sent to the wedding.

14:01.440 --> 14:02.500
You bastard!

14:04.350 --> 14:05.000
Tan'er!

14:13.480 --> 14:14.460
Tan'er!

14:28.480 --> 14:29.550
Tan'er!

15:07.930 --> 15:08.700
Tan'er!

15:35.780 --> 15:36.610
Tan'er!

15:49.320 --> 15:49.910
Bingzhu?

15:51.550 --> 15:52.080
Bingzhu?

15:53.410 --> 15:54.270
-Tan'er.
-Run!

15:54.870 --> 15:56.000
Bingzhu, run!

15:57.120 --> 15:58.360
Don't worry about me!

15:58.600 --> 15:59.550
Bingzhu!

16:00.000 --> 16:00.720
Bingzhu!

16:03.600 --> 16:04.600
Bingzhu!

16:05.600 --> 16:06.570
Tan'er!

16:06.750 --> 16:07.750
Bingzhu!

16:12.200 --> 16:12.790
Bingzhu!

16:13.960 --> 16:14.550
Bingzhu!

16:18.270 --> 16:20.390
Bingzhu!

18:30.310 --> 18:30.880
Tan'er.

18:31.350 --> 18:32.110
Tan'er!

18:48.040 --> 18:49.440
Tan'er, don't be afraid.

18:49.830 --> 18:51.200
I'm coming to save you.

18:51.350 --> 18:52.000
Tan'er!

18:57.100 --> 18:57.750
Tan'er?

19:01.160 --> 19:01.790
Bingzhu,

19:02.830 --> 19:03.680
I...

19:05.490 --> 19:07.730
I... can stay with you forever now.

19:10.920 --> 19:11.510
Tan'er.

19:11.940 --> 19:13.680
Tan'er, don't go! Tan'er!

19:15.680 --> 19:16.510
Tan'er!

19:20.880 --> 19:22.180
Tan'er!

19:30.440 --> 19:31.790
Tan'er...

19:33.920 --> 19:35.550
Tan'er!

19:38.530 --> 19:41.590
The last soul
of Tan'er's three souls and seven spirits

19:41.640 --> 19:43.160
was bound to this blade,

19:44.490 --> 19:46.690
turning it into a demon-slaying blade.

19:48.000 --> 19:49.400
Later, I joined the army,

19:50.070 --> 19:51.870
was assigned to the Feiyu Guard,

19:52.400 --> 19:54.930
and rose through the ranks
to where I am today.

19:55.480 --> 19:56.880
That is why my sister and I

19:57.740 --> 19:59.600
have a blood feud with the demons.

20:03.160 --> 20:04.790
My sister has quite a temper.

20:06.880 --> 20:09.270
Only when she senses the demon
she wants to slay

20:09.270 --> 20:10.730
will she leave the sheath.

20:11.110 --> 20:12.140
Once drawn,

20:12.510 --> 20:15.970
she will not return until
she has drunk her fill of demon blood.

20:16.310 --> 20:18.110
But she's seen you several times

20:18.400 --> 20:19.600
and never made a move.

20:20.610 --> 20:23.540
That proves
that even though you have become a demon,

20:24.100 --> 20:25.600
your nature remains pure.

20:28.720 --> 20:30.070
How touching.

20:31.400 --> 20:31.920
What?

20:33.510 --> 20:35.070
Nothing. Please continue.

20:38.830 --> 20:40.360
So I've been thinking that,

20:40.790 --> 20:42.590
since Tan'er trusts you so much,

20:43.310 --> 20:44.840
you should take her with you

20:45.640 --> 20:46.500
to find Hong Ye.

20:48.830 --> 20:50.500
Only when her long-cherished wish
is fulfilled

20:50.500 --> 20:52.960
will Tan'er's
three souls and seven spirits return,

20:52.960 --> 20:55.890
allowing her to reenter
the cycle of reincarnation.

20:56.720 --> 20:59.230
What is her long-cherished wish?

20:59.530 --> 21:01.860
To eliminate all evil demons in the world.

21:04.040 --> 21:05.840
Once Tan'er encounters Hong Ye,

21:05.960 --> 21:07.320
I will appear at once.

21:08.830 --> 21:10.400
That will be the best chance

21:10.400 --> 21:12.530
to kill the Demon King once and for all.

21:13.380 --> 21:16.910
Hong Ye and the demons in the
Demons' Valley are not evil demons.

21:19.160 --> 21:21.700
Do you know what he did 100 years ago?

21:25.400 --> 21:26.270
I don't know,

21:26.720 --> 21:28.050
and I don't need to know.

21:29.980 --> 21:31.790
You didn't witness

21:31.790 --> 21:33.030
what happened 100 years ago yourself.

21:33.030 --> 21:35.760
On what grounds do you conclude
that Hong Ye is...

21:37.960 --> 21:39.330
According to the records,

21:39.330 --> 21:41.350
he once bewitched Princess Ning'an.

21:41.350 --> 21:43.570
He killed many people back then.

21:43.850 --> 21:47.350
The court had to expend the strength
of the entire realm to seal him away.

21:47.350 --> 21:48.140
Xiao Yao.

21:49.070 --> 21:50.390
Have you got up?

21:51.350 --> 21:52.160
Anyway,

21:53.160 --> 21:54.070
Tan'er has never

21:54.070 --> 21:55.350
trusted anyone but me.

21:58.310 --> 21:59.550
Don't let her down.

22:01.640 --> 22:02.540
Xiao Yao!

22:07.200 --> 22:07.880
Xiao Yao,

22:08.310 --> 22:08.860
look.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.730
Do you notice any changes in me?

22:13.400 --> 22:14.030
Well... It's...

22:14.030 --> 22:14.720
My face.

22:15.400 --> 22:16.230
My skin.

22:17.480 --> 22:18.720
Softer and fairer.

22:18.720 --> 22:19.270
Really?

22:19.640 --> 22:20.960
It actually works!

22:21.070 --> 22:22.130
Here's one for you.

22:22.640 --> 22:23.900
Isn't this that blade?

22:24.160 --> 22:25.290
Where did you get it?

22:25.640 --> 22:27.160
Money can solve anything.

22:30.200 --> 22:32.200
This blade looks quite impressive.

22:32.470 --> 22:33.330
Oh my goodness!

22:33.830 --> 22:34.940
Why is it so fierce?

22:35.270 --> 22:36.470
Is it going to kill me?

22:36.510 --> 22:37.970
You haven't done any evil.

22:38.110 --> 22:39.110
It won't kill you.

22:39.640 --> 22:41.070
Master Blade,

22:41.070 --> 22:42.570
we bear no grudge,

22:42.880 --> 22:44.120
and I mean no offense.

22:44.240 --> 22:46.370
Let's get along peacefully, shall we?

22:47.310 --> 22:48.240
Where's Luoluo?

22:48.240 --> 22:49.270
Luoluo!

22:50.200 --> 22:50.720
Luoluo!

22:51.310 --> 22:52.390
We should go now.

22:58.550 --> 22:59.880
What are you doing here?

23:02.310 --> 23:03.440
Xiao Yao, he's here.

23:04.750 --> 23:05.590
What's wrong?

23:08.790 --> 23:10.250
What's wrong with Luoluo?

23:12.110 --> 23:13.670
Yueyue is missing.

23:14.550 --> 23:15.110
Yueyue?

23:15.720 --> 23:16.830
Who is Yueyue?

23:16.830 --> 23:18.030
My friend.

23:18.960 --> 23:20.680
I've searched the building, the courtyard,

23:20.680 --> 23:22.830
the woodshed, the kitchen—everywhere,

23:22.830 --> 23:24.030
but she's nowhere to be found.

23:24.030 --> 23:25.610
Even her scent is gone.

23:26.200 --> 23:27.440
They all say she ran away,

23:27.440 --> 23:28.970
but I know she wouldn't.

23:29.350 --> 23:32.480
She would never leave behind
the grasshopper I gave her.

23:38.440 --> 23:39.120
Flower Lady,

23:39.120 --> 23:40.650
I told you not to wander off.

23:41.680 --> 23:42.500
Flower Lady,

23:43.070 --> 23:44.670
you'll catch cold like this.

23:45.510 --> 23:47.170
Flower Lady, don't be afraid.

23:48.310 --> 23:49.070
Flower Lady,

23:49.200 --> 23:50.730
where are you? Flower Lady?

23:53.110 --> 23:53.840
Flower Lady?

23:55.550 --> 23:57.210
Flower Lady, don't be afraid.

23:59.350 --> 24:00.090
Flower Lady.

24:02.480 --> 24:03.410
Don't be afraid.

24:03.680 --> 24:04.610
Don't be afraid.

24:10.920 --> 24:11.720
How's it going?

24:11.720 --> 24:12.640
We couldn't find her.

24:12.640 --> 24:12.880
Nothing.

24:12.880 --> 24:13.640
Keep looking! Hurry!

24:13.640 --> 24:14.300
-Yes.
-Yes.

24:25.820 --> 24:26.440
My Lord?

24:27.830 --> 24:28.690
What happened?

24:29.000 --> 24:30.130
Where is your blade?

24:31.030 --> 24:31.590
I sold it.

24:32.720 --> 24:33.830
Where's the cartload of gold?

24:33.830 --> 24:35.760
Do you need us to help bring it back?

24:37.120 --> 24:39.110
Cartload... and gold?

24:40.280 --> 24:43.510
Put the words "cartload" and "gold"
together and you get "slay".

24:43.510 --> 24:46.440
The demon-slaying blade has gone
to take the Demon King's head.

24:46.440 --> 24:47.640
Once the deed is done,

24:47.680 --> 24:50.410
the court's rewards
will surely come to all of us.

24:52.160 --> 24:53.090
What's going on?

24:54.800 --> 24:55.510
Oh right.

24:55.510 --> 24:57.570
My Lord, the magistrate's office...

24:59.830 --> 25:01.550
The magistrate's office is in chaos.

25:01.550 --> 25:02.960
The daughter of the Qionghua Sect's leader
is missing.

25:02.960 --> 25:04.400
They've stormed
the magistrate's office demanding her.

25:04.400 --> 25:06.040
They're about to tear the place down.

25:06.040 --> 25:07.410
[Righteousness]

25:14.110 --> 25:17.330
My junior sister disappeared
in your Pingjiang Prefecture.

25:17.330 --> 25:18.870
If anything happens to her,

25:19.040 --> 25:22.180
I will make sure
your entire Pingjiang knows no peace.

25:22.470 --> 25:24.190
If she is not found today,

25:24.640 --> 25:25.920
your magistrate's office

25:25.920 --> 25:26.750
will be torn down.

25:26.750 --> 25:27.350
Yes!

25:27.350 --> 25:28.940
Tear it down!

25:29.070 --> 25:29.680
Everyone.

25:30.350 --> 25:32.110
Young heroes!

25:32.510 --> 25:34.320
As you can all see,

25:34.400 --> 25:36.160
right now, in this main hall
of the magistrate's office,

25:36.160 --> 25:38.220
there isn't a single constable left.

25:38.310 --> 25:40.570
They've all been sent out to look for her.

25:40.790 --> 25:42.310
I'm just a low-rank official.

25:42.310 --> 25:44.640
Please don't make things difficult for me.

25:44.640 --> 25:47.110
I've already sent someone to fetch
the Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guard

25:47.110 --> 25:48.350
to take charge of this matter.

25:48.350 --> 25:49.410
He'll be here soon.

25:49.750 --> 25:50.550
Very soon.

25:51.110 --> 25:52.110
Please calm down.

25:52.190 --> 25:53.130
Calm down.

25:53.150 --> 25:53.640
Please remain...

25:53.640 --> 25:55.750
Don't try to intimidate me
with an official.

25:55.750 --> 25:56.960
It's the same whoever comes.

25:56.960 --> 25:57.720
How dare you!

26:19.440 --> 26:21.640
This is an official government office.

26:21.750 --> 26:23.830
How dare you cause trouble here?

26:35.240 --> 26:36.170
Are you the one in charge?

26:36.170 --> 26:38.480
I am Bingzhu of the Feiyu Guard.

26:40.100 --> 26:42.230
We are disciples of the Qionghua Sect.

26:42.920 --> 26:45.080
Leader Jin's only daughter

26:45.200 --> 26:47.510
went missing this morning in Pingjiang

26:47.510 --> 26:48.640
without a trace.

26:49.790 --> 26:51.000
We're here to report her disappearance.

26:51.000 --> 26:53.030
The report should be filed by the family.

26:53.030 --> 26:56.290
Whoever lost their daughter
should speak for themselves.

26:56.400 --> 26:57.400
All others,

26:59.070 --> 26:59.790
get out!

27:21.680 --> 27:22.440
Step back!

27:26.960 --> 27:27.620
Take a seat.

27:28.480 --> 27:29.070
No need.

27:29.720 --> 27:31.160
Since we're here to file a report,

27:31.160 --> 27:34.880
we'll do it according to the procedures
of the magistrate's office.

27:34.880 --> 27:35.480
Speak.

27:38.490 --> 27:39.040
My Lord,

27:40.030 --> 27:41.440
I am Jin Muqing,

27:42.000 --> 27:43.600
leader of the Qionghua Sect.

27:43.790 --> 27:45.350
This is my wife.

27:45.790 --> 27:47.510
I have a daughter

27:47.680 --> 27:48.750
named Yunyi

27:48.920 --> 27:50.650
who has been blind since birth.

27:50.720 --> 27:53.240
We came to Pingjiang with our disciples

27:53.750 --> 27:55.590
to eliminate demons

27:55.590 --> 27:56.720
and uphold justice.

27:57.270 --> 28:00.000
Our daughter insisted on coming with us,

28:00.200 --> 28:01.730
and we could not refuse her,

28:01.790 --> 28:03.120
so we brought her along.

28:03.710 --> 28:05.840
But unexpectedly, this morning,

28:06.480 --> 28:08.680
her cat went missing from the backyard.

28:08.680 --> 28:09.640
So she went after it

28:09.640 --> 28:11.170
and has not returned since.

28:11.920 --> 28:14.630
We've searched all of Pingjiang

28:15.720 --> 28:17.480
and only found this.

28:21.440 --> 28:22.100
Have you...

28:22.350 --> 28:23.240
found the cat?

28:26.910 --> 28:28.550
So far, we don't know whether the one

28:28.550 --> 28:31.130
who abducted your daughter
was human or a demon.

28:31.130 --> 28:32.520
That is precisely

28:32.550 --> 28:34.210
why I came to the authorities.

28:34.550 --> 28:35.350
We've learned that

28:35.350 --> 28:37.720
several young women have gone missing
in Pingjiang these past few days.

28:37.720 --> 28:39.580
Do you really have no leads at all?

28:39.880 --> 28:43.010
Recently, the Feiyu Guard
wiped out the Demons' Valley.

28:43.570 --> 28:46.110
We cannot rule out
the possibility that surviving demons

28:46.110 --> 28:47.640
have returned for revenge.

28:47.720 --> 28:48.240
My Lord,

28:48.920 --> 28:50.880
we have placed talismans and seals

28:50.880 --> 28:52.780
throughout Pingjiang.

28:53.070 --> 28:55.110
If any minor demons are causing trouble,

28:55.110 --> 28:58.890
they will not escape
the Qionghua Sect's swords.

29:04.030 --> 29:05.360
We will handle this case

29:05.400 --> 29:06.640
with full commitment

29:07.680 --> 29:10.030
and give the Qionghua Sect
and the people of the city

29:10.030 --> 29:11.290
a proper explanation.

29:12.440 --> 29:13.880
It had better be so.

29:16.030 --> 29:16.830
Prefect.

29:22.000 --> 29:23.240
Please close the city gates

29:23.240 --> 29:24.240
and post notices.

29:24.590 --> 29:25.920
Until this case is solved,

29:25.920 --> 29:27.580
women, children, and the weak

29:27.720 --> 29:29.000
are not to go out alone.

29:30.200 --> 29:31.060
As you command.

29:35.110 --> 29:36.500
Her scent is here!

29:36.640 --> 29:37.350
Luoluo!

29:37.480 --> 29:38.030
Luoluo!

29:38.400 --> 29:40.110
This place is so far from Pingjiang.

29:40.110 --> 29:41.650
Yueyue wouldn't come here.

29:42.160 --> 29:43.750
-She's in the water!
-Luoluo.

29:43.750 --> 29:45.310
-How could a person be in the water?
-Get up.

29:45.310 --> 29:45.920
Luoluo!

29:46.310 --> 29:48.110
-Did you smell it wrong?
-Get up. Get up!

29:48.110 --> 29:48.750
Yueyue!

29:49.000 --> 29:49.440
Get up!

29:49.440 --> 29:50.290
Yueyue!

29:52.880 --> 29:53.670
It's Yueyue!

29:54.200 --> 29:54.950
Yueyue!

29:55.310 --> 29:56.350
It's Yueyue!

29:56.640 --> 29:57.920
I need to save her!

29:58.200 --> 29:58.900
Luoluo!

29:58.930 --> 29:59.440
Get up!

29:59.440 --> 30:00.510
Luoluo, get up!

30:00.510 --> 30:01.270
Get up now!

30:01.270 --> 30:03.880
I heard that in cases like this, it's
a water ghost looking for a replacement.

30:03.880 --> 30:05.440
What should we do?

30:05.790 --> 30:06.520
I'll go down.

30:06.960 --> 30:07.790
No, no, Xiao Yao.

30:07.790 --> 30:09.500
You just said there's a water ghost
in there.

30:09.500 --> 30:11.160
It's fine. I'm a good swimmer.

30:11.590 --> 30:12.300
No!

30:12.680 --> 30:13.750
Here, take this.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.740
I'm afraid to hold it!

30:17.750 --> 30:18.480
Watch it carefully.

30:18.480 --> 30:19.360
Alright.

32:21.000 --> 32:24.280
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

32:25.240 --> 32:27.930
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

32:29.120 --> 32:31.560
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

32:32.760 --> 32:35.570
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

32:36.510 --> 32:39.570
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

32:40.660 --> 32:43.350
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

32:44.220 --> 32:46.950
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

32:48.680 --> 32:50.290
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

32:49.000 --> 32:50.610
Why is there no sound?

32:51.430 --> 32:54.570
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

32:55.480 --> 32:58.020
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

32:57.790 --> 32:58.700
Come here, Luoluo!

32:58.700 --> 33:02.090
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

32:59.880 --> 33:00.940
What's happening?

33:01.510 --> 33:03.210
It's trying to get out of the sheath.

33:03.210 --> 33:05.320
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

33:03.680 --> 33:04.480
Xiao Yao!

33:06.450 --> 33:09.670
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

33:10.650 --> 33:13.220
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

33:14.090 --> 33:17.420
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

33:18.370 --> 33:23.880
♪ We forsake three lifetimes of marriage,
only to fulfill our wishes ♪

33:26.610 --> 33:28.380
♪ Our wishes ♪

33:34.200 --> 33:34.830
Xiao Yao?

33:35.510 --> 33:36.370
Oh my goodness.

33:38.480 --> 33:39.310
Is she awake?

33:41.750 --> 33:42.510
Xiao Yao.

33:46.400 --> 33:47.730
Xiao Yao, you're awake?

33:48.720 --> 33:51.160
It was Lord Bingzhu who just saved you.

33:55.440 --> 33:56.370
Are you alright?

33:59.550 --> 34:00.830
How is it you?

34:01.310 --> 34:02.440
Who else would it be?

34:03.640 --> 34:05.240
I received Tan'er's signal.

34:05.240 --> 34:07.570
Tan'er told me a great demon had appeared.

34:07.590 --> 34:08.670
And I promised you

34:09.280 --> 34:10.480
I would keep you safe.

34:12.630 --> 34:13.530
Did you see...

34:15.960 --> 34:16.630
Yes, I did.

34:17.760 --> 34:19.560
The lake is full of water ghosts,

34:19.590 --> 34:21.449
souls of those who died unjustly.

34:21.840 --> 34:23.770
Tan'er couldn't bear to slay them.

34:24.230 --> 34:27.090
We've already sent boatmen
to retrieve the bodies.

34:28.030 --> 34:28.739
Xiao Yao,

34:29.360 --> 34:30.600
did you see Yueyue?

34:34.190 --> 34:35.070
Not just her.

34:35.670 --> 34:37.199
There were other girls too,

34:37.320 --> 34:38.340
six in total.

34:42.960 --> 34:44.550
It's alright. It's alright.

34:44.550 --> 34:45.350
There, there.

34:45.360 --> 34:46.880
Don't be sad. Don't be sad.

34:46.880 --> 34:47.880
It's alright, Luoluo.

34:47.880 --> 34:48.920
You know

34:49.949 --> 34:50.750
those bodies?

34:50.880 --> 34:53.270
Yueyue was my friend.

34:54.139 --> 34:57.450
She was just as kind as Xiao Yao and Dali.

34:57.590 --> 34:58.630
It's alright.

35:03.070 --> 35:05.000
Then you should step aside for now.

35:05.110 --> 35:07.320
I'm afraid once the bodies are brought up,

35:07.320 --> 35:09.320
seeing them will be too much for you.

35:11.190 --> 35:12.000
Go back now.

35:14.400 --> 35:15.200
Yes, Xiao Yao.

35:15.360 --> 35:17.330
Hurry. You're soaking wet.

35:18.000 --> 35:18.510
Yueyue...

35:18.510 --> 35:19.070
Get up.

35:19.760 --> 35:20.360
Let's go.

35:26.320 --> 35:28.190
I clearly saw Hong Ye.

35:28.350 --> 35:29.920
How did it end up being him?

35:30.510 --> 35:31.310
Wait a moment.

35:36.510 --> 35:37.420
Lord Bingzhu.

35:37.630 --> 35:38.560
Don't be afraid.

35:39.400 --> 35:40.350
May I ask

35:40.630 --> 35:42.000
how you saved me?

35:44.110 --> 35:45.770
Didn't they already tell you?

35:46.960 --> 35:48.490
I... What I want to ask is...

35:48.800 --> 35:49.480
well...

35:51.150 --> 35:51.880
did you...

35:52.670 --> 35:53.640
give me...

35:54.150 --> 35:55.280
mouth-to-mouth...

35:55.400 --> 35:56.190
in the water?

35:56.480 --> 35:57.480
Mouth-to-mouth?

35:58.000 --> 35:58.440
Yes.

35:59.280 --> 36:00.030
Absurd!

36:00.630 --> 36:01.920
You... you...

36:01.940 --> 36:03.030
You weren't out of air.

36:03.030 --> 36:04.960
There was no need for such contact.

36:07.400 --> 36:08.510
That's good then.

36:09.480 --> 36:10.360
I was just asking.

36:10.360 --> 36:11.280
If you didn't, then you didn't.

36:11.280 --> 36:12.300
Why are you getting angry?

36:12.300 --> 36:13.300
Why so fierce?

36:16.110 --> 36:16.710
Come back.

36:19.440 --> 36:21.300
Tan'er still needs to be with you.

36:37.000 --> 36:37.630
Hong Ye,

36:38.560 --> 36:40.620
was it really you who saved me?

36:53.210 --> 36:56.210
Does this pendant stop working
once it touches water?

37:08.400 --> 37:09.260
One more time.

37:19.670 --> 37:21.190
Isn't this a scam?

37:22.840 --> 37:24.360
In my travels,

37:24.360 --> 37:26.550
I only trick people
out of small change and food at most.

37:26.550 --> 37:29.280
But you actually trick people
out of their lives.

37:29.840 --> 37:30.320
I...

37:31.920 --> 37:33.000
Come on.

37:45.330 --> 37:47.130
Do you think you're still human?

37:47.400 --> 37:48.800
You're a demon yourself.

37:49.440 --> 37:52.500
Why do you still persecute the demons
so relentlessly?

38:11.510 --> 38:12.190
Tan'er,

38:12.320 --> 38:14.250
please don't move without reason.

38:23.790 --> 38:27.480
[Pingjiang Prefecture Office]

38:29.110 --> 38:29.630
My Lord,

38:58.880 --> 39:00.080
they're all the same.

39:00.110 --> 39:02.360
Their blood has been completely drained.

39:02.360 --> 39:04.030
If it's only the blood that was drained,

39:04.030 --> 39:06.030
why have their pupils turned black,

39:08.510 --> 39:10.510
and why is their skin still elastic?

39:33.840 --> 39:34.550
This is...

39:35.070 --> 39:36.270
Soul-binding Spell.

39:39.570 --> 39:40.110
My Lord.

39:40.900 --> 39:44.430
My Lord, the victims' families
are here to identify the bodies.

39:55.340 --> 39:56.230
Yue...

39:57.590 --> 39:58.790
Keep your voice down.

40:00.900 --> 40:02.700
Down there are all Feiyu Guards.

40:03.030 --> 40:04.360
We can only

40:04.360 --> 40:06.020
take one last look at her here.

40:07.020 --> 40:08.840
Yueyue was the only one

40:08.860 --> 40:11.320
who ever treated me
that well besides my mom.

40:16.280 --> 40:17.800
My child!

40:18.690 --> 40:21.230
My daughter! My daughter!

40:22.070 --> 40:24.560
I can't even cry for her openly

40:24.590 --> 40:27.190
like the people inside.

40:27.320 --> 40:28.400
Alright, Luoluo.

40:28.400 --> 40:30.240
We'll be good to you too.

40:30.480 --> 40:32.480
My daughter died unjustly!

40:32.750 --> 40:34.550
My Lord, please find the culprit

40:34.630 --> 40:36.300
and avenge my daughter!

40:36.400 --> 40:37.440
My condolences, everyone.

40:37.440 --> 40:39.090
We will capture the culprit
as soon as possible

40:39.090 --> 40:40.350
and bring you justice.

40:42.010 --> 40:42.400
My Lord.

40:42.400 --> 40:43.550
I'm begging you.

40:47.940 --> 40:48.510
Master,

40:48.760 --> 40:49.820
Junior is not here.

40:50.590 --> 40:51.110
Are...

40:51.550 --> 40:52.760
Are you sure?

40:53.440 --> 40:54.030
Yes.

41:13.360 --> 41:14.320
Feiyu Guard,

41:14.880 --> 41:16.150
are you absolutely certain

41:16.150 --> 41:18.280
no other bodies were found in the lake?

41:18.360 --> 41:20.030
We've searched the whole lake.

41:20.030 --> 41:21.960
There were indeed no other bodies.

41:22.550 --> 41:23.180
Well...

41:23.620 --> 41:25.880
So we still have a glimmer of hope, right?

41:26.480 --> 41:27.880
These bodies cannot remain overnight.

41:27.880 --> 41:29.440
They'll transform if exposed to moonlight.

41:29.440 --> 41:31.500
Arrange for cremation immediately.

41:32.430 --> 41:33.630
Take the bodies away.

41:33.960 --> 41:34.890
Family members,

41:35.150 --> 41:36.150
please follow me.

41:40.480 --> 41:41.200
My Lord,

41:41.350 --> 41:43.000
Just now, I noticed that

41:43.070 --> 41:44.850
although the bodies
were submerged in the lake,

41:43.490 --> 41:46.930
[Justice of the World]

41:45.030 --> 41:46.840
there was no sign of decay,

41:47.230 --> 41:49.770
and their skin was still elastic.

41:50.190 --> 41:50.650
It's...

41:51.070 --> 41:51.880
These girls

41:52.590 --> 41:53.840
all died after the blood in their bodies

41:53.840 --> 41:55.240
was completely drained.

41:56.710 --> 41:58.440
How incredibly cruel.

41:59.410 --> 42:01.510
The murderer not only drained their blood

42:01.510 --> 42:03.280
but also cast the Soul-binding Spell

42:03.280 --> 42:05.340
before throwing them into the water.

42:05.400 --> 42:06.730
That is why their bodies

42:07.000 --> 42:08.280
neither rotted nor sank,

42:08.280 --> 42:09.670
were neither dead nor alive,

42:09.670 --> 42:11.230
are unable to enter reincarnation,

42:11.230 --> 42:13.280
and are difficult for the living to find.

42:13.280 --> 42:16.150
They are suspended forever
between the three realms.

42:16.150 --> 42:17.400
The Soul-binding Spell

42:17.400 --> 42:18.600
is extremely complex

42:18.760 --> 42:21.050
and very hard to perform.

42:21.280 --> 42:23.430
It has not appeared for over 100 years.

42:23.670 --> 42:24.150
My Lord,

42:24.710 --> 42:26.510
are you certain of this?

42:27.280 --> 42:29.840
It is recorded in the secret archives
of the Feiyu Guard.

42:29.840 --> 42:31.150
Because this spell is so vicious,

42:31.150 --> 42:32.880
it left a deep impression on me.

42:33.230 --> 42:35.760
If not for the overwhelming resentment
of these women,

42:35.760 --> 42:37.110
who died unjustly,
breaking through the spell

42:37.110 --> 42:38.570
and drawing people there,

42:38.670 --> 42:40.480
we might never have found them.

42:41.580 --> 42:42.800
Such cruel methods,

42:43.550 --> 42:46.110
and the ability to use
a forbidden technique from a century ago—

42:46.110 --> 42:47.960
other than the Demon King Hong Ye,

42:47.960 --> 42:49.440
I can't think of anyone else.

42:49.440 --> 42:51.480
Since our daughter has not yet been found,

42:51.480 --> 42:52.740
there should still be

42:53.320 --> 42:54.610
a sliver of hope.

42:57.000 --> 42:57.750
My Lord,

42:58.670 --> 43:02.870
we earnestly ask the Feiyu Guard to
capture the culprit as soon as possible.

43:03.080 --> 43:03.760
Please.

43:04.120 --> 43:04.980
Of course.

43:13.000 --> 43:13.800
Sir.

43:18.590 --> 43:19.110
Sir,

43:19.840 --> 43:22.190
what should we do now?

43:22.480 --> 43:23.280
Mr. Liu,

43:23.760 --> 43:25.920
Pingjiang Prefecture
is under your jurisdiction.

43:25.920 --> 43:27.760
With such a major case having occurred,

43:27.760 --> 43:29.160
as the local magistrate,

43:29.440 --> 43:31.500
shouldn't you do something about it?

43:31.510 --> 43:32.630
Do something?

43:32.920 --> 43:34.190
Catching demons

43:34.190 --> 43:36.480
is simply beyond my abilities.

43:36.480 --> 43:37.110
Mr. Liu,

43:38.110 --> 43:40.550
would you be willing
to use your two daughters as bait

43:40.550 --> 43:41.510
to lure out the Demon King

43:41.510 --> 43:42.670
and rid the people of this menace?

43:42.670 --> 43:43.600
Absolutely not!

43:43.760 --> 43:44.150
I...

43:44.150 --> 43:45.400
With the Feiyu Guard here,

43:45.400 --> 43:46.550
you have nothing to fear.

43:46.550 --> 43:48.150
We will ensure their safety.

43:48.630 --> 43:50.360
This great demon
has grown far too rampant.

43:50.360 --> 43:51.860
If we don't find a way to slay it...

43:51.860 --> 43:52.660
Xiao Yao,

43:52.800 --> 43:53.360
let's go.

43:53.360 --> 43:54.480
That's still not acceptable.

43:54.480 --> 43:56.110
I only have these two precious daughters.

43:56.110 --> 43:58.280
I cannot watch them
be sent to their deaths.

43:58.280 --> 44:01.070
And how do you know the next victim
won't be your family?

44:01.070 --> 44:02.830
It absolutely won't happen to my family.
